#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Pay a one-off amount'
#: hrms/payroll/onboarding_step/create_additional_salary/create_additional_salary.json:5
msgid "A bonus, arrear or deduction for one payroll period. See [Additional Salary](https://docs.frappe.io/hr/additional-salary)."
