#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Plan a training program'
#: hrms/tenure/onboarding_step/create_training_program/create_training_program.json:5
msgid "A course you run for employees, with its trainer and what it covers. See [Training Program](https://docs.frappe.io/hr/training-program)."
msgstr "Курс для сотрудников с указанием преподавателя и содержания. См. [Программа обучения](https://docs.frappe.io/hr/training-program)."

#: hrms/controllers/employee_reminders.py:125
#: hrms/controllers/employee_reminders.py:210
